      "generated_answer": "The study demonstrates that using 3D ultrasound to validate large-core needle biopsies resulted in high sensitivity (96.9%) and specificity (100%) with a median of only two samples per lesion. These results indicate that the method is highly accurate and effective for histological assessment. Therefore, the most likely correct answer is yes.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
      "success": true,
