      "generated_answer": "After realizing that *The Orchid Thief* lacks a usable narrative and is impossible to adapt into a film, Charlie is left with a serious case of writer's block. This struggle is compounded by the fact that he is already well past his deadline with Columbia Pictures.\n\n\\boxed{a serious case of writer's block}",
