      "generated_answer": "Costello grooms Colin Sullivan to become a mole inside the Massachusetts State Police. This position allows Sullivan to act as an infiltrator for Costello's criminal organization from within the Special Investigations Unit.\n\n\\boxed{Costello grooms Colin Sullivan to become a mole inside the Massachusetts State Police.}",
