      "generated_answer": "The passage describes the decision to use the 38th parallel as a dividing line, which ultimately led to Korea's long-standing division into two separate nations. This is the most direct and lasting effect on Koreans as depicted. Therefore, the correct answer is C.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
