      "generated_answer": "The passage emphasizes that perestroika is an \"urgent necessity\" and warns that delay could lead to \"serious social, economic, and political crises.\" This directly supports the idea that restructuring was needed to avoid such crises. Therefore, the correct answer is that restructuring was necessary to avoid a crisis.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
