    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The Carlsbad Resolutions were designed to suppress liberal and nationalist movements across the German states, reflecting Metternich's conservative agenda. The provided Press Law enforces censorship to protect state honor and security, directly targeting revolutionary ideas. Thus, the correct answer is C.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
      "success": true,
