      "generated_answer": "The excerpt shows Tacitus celebrating the destruction of a Germanic tribe by neighboring tribes, highlighting a Roman strategic preference for barbarian discord over direct conflict. This reflects Roman concern about barbarian attacks and a desire to avoid costly military engagements. Thus, the correct answer is B.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
      "success": true,
