    "prediction": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef countSubMultisets(nums, l, r):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    freq = Counter(nums)\n    zero = freq.pop(0, 0)\n    max_sum = r\n    dp = [0] * (max_sum + 1)\n    dp[0] = 1\n    for x, m in freq.items():\n        if x > max_sum:\n            continue\n        new_dp = [0] * (max_sum + 1)\n        for rem in range(x):\n            if rem > max_sum:\n                continue\n            prefix = [0]\n            j = 0\n            while True:\n                s = rem + j * x\n                if s > max_sum:\n                    break\n                prefix.append((prefix[-1] + dp[s]) % MOD)\n                j += 1\n            num_pos = j\n            for jj in range(num_pos):\n                s = rem + jj * x\n                left = max(0, jj - m)\n                new_val = (prefix[jj + 1] - prefix[left]) % MOD\n                new_dp[s] = new_val\n        dp = new_dp\n    multi = (zero + 1) % MOD\n    for i in range(max_sum + 1):\n        dp[i] = dp[i] * multi % MOD\n    ans = 0\n    start = max(l, 0)\n    for s in range(start, max_sum + 1):\n        ans = (ans + dp[s]) % MOD\n    return ans\n```",
