      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_operations(s1: str, s2: str, s3: str) -> int:\n    # Find the length of the longest common prefix\n    L = 0\n    min_len = min(len(s1), len(s2), len(s3))\n    while L < min_len and s1[L] == s2[L] == s3[L]:\n        L += 1\n    # If no common character at the first position, impossible\n    if L == 0:\n        return -1\n    # Total deletions = sum of (original length - common prefix length)\n    return (len(s1) - L) + (len(s2) - L) + (len(s3) - L)\n```",
