      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minCoins(prices):\n    n = len(prices)\n    # dp[i] = minimum coins to acquire first i fruits (1-indexed)\n    dp = [float('inf')] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0  # no fruits, no cost\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        cost = prices[i - 1]  # cost of fruit i\n        # purchase fruit i covers fruits i to min(n, i+i)\n        end = min(n, i + i)\n        for j in range(i, end + 1):\n            dp[j] = min(dp[j], dp[i - 1] + cost)\n    \n    return dp[n]\n```",
