      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef minimumCoins(prices: List[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(prices)\n    dp = [float('inf')] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    for j in range(n):\n        if dp[j] != float('inf'):\n            cost = dp[j] + prices[j]\n            max_cover = min(n, 2 * j + 2)\n            for k in range(j, max_cover + 1):\n                dp[k] = min(dp[k], cost)\n    return dp[n]\n```",
