      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef distinctDifferenceArray(nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n    n = len(nums)\n    suffix_freq = Counter(nums)\n    prefix_set = set()\n    diff = [0] * n\n    for i in range(n):\n        # Remove current element from suffix\n        suffix_freq[nums[i]] -= 1\n        if suffix_freq[nums[i]] == 0:\n            del suffix_freq[nums[i]]\n        # Add current element to prefix\n        prefix_set.add(nums[i])\n        # Compute difference\n        diff[i] = len(prefix_set) - len(suffix_freq)\n    return diff\n```",
