      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef distinctDifferenceArray(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    \n    # prefix[i] = number of distinct elements in nums[0..i]\n    prefix = [0] * n\n    seen = set()\n    for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n        seen.add(x)\n        prefix[i] = len(seen)\n    \n    # suffix[i] = number of distinct elements in nums[i..n-1]\n    # we allocate n+1 so that suffix[n] = 0 naturally\n    suffix = [0] * (n + 1)\n    seen.clear()\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        seen.add(nums[i])\n        suffix[i] = len(seen)\n    \n    # diff[i] = prefix[i] - suffix[i+1]\n    diff = [0] * n\n    for i in range(n):\n        diff[i] = prefix[i] - suffix[i + 1]\n    return diff\n```",
