      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef sumOfPower(nums: List[int]) -> int:\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    nums.sort()\n    n = len(nums)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    pow2 = [0] * (n + 1)\n    pow2[0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        pow2[i] = pow2[i - 1] * 2 % MOD\n    inv2 = pow(2, MOD - 2, MOD)\n    invpow = [0] * (n + 1)\n    invpow[0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        invpow[i] = invpow[i - 1] * inv2 % MOD\n    suffix = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for k in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        term = 0\n        if k > 0:\n            ak2 = (nums[k] % MOD) * (nums[k] % MOD) % MOD\n            term = ak2 * pow2[k - 1] % MOD\n        suffix[k] = (suffix[k + 1] + term) % MOD\n    ans = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        inner = 0\n        if i + 1 < n:\n            inner = invpow[i] * suffix[i + 1] % MOD\n        diag = (nums[i] % MOD) * (nums[i] % MOD) % MOD\n        total_i = (diag + inner) % MOD\n        contrib = (nums[i] % MOD) * total_i % MOD\n        ans = (ans + contrib) % MOD\n    return ans\n```",
